
>> animal := Objekt nĳ. 
 
 animal by: ['name:'] dwaan: { :n
eigen namme := n.
}. 


animal name: ['Diva']. 
 
animal by: ['namme'] dwaan: { <- namme.
}.

>> cat := animal nĳ.
 
 cat name: ['Diva']. 
 
 cat by: ['namme'] dwaan: { <- ['your royal highness ']
+ (sels namme).
}.

Utfier skriuwe: cat namme.
